      "text": "Uses `[StructLayout(LayoutKind.Explicit)]` to create x86-style register aliasing \u2014 EAX, AX, AH, AL all overlap the same memory at different offsets. Individual flag bools (CarryFlag, ZeroFlag, etc.) are stored separately and assembled/disassembled to/from the FLAGS\u0192 register via `F()` / `SetF()`."
