      "text": "The primary memory implementation. Stores segments as `byte[0x10000][]` \u2014 an array of 65,536 possible segments, each up to 65,535 bytes. Also maintains parallel arrays for segment metadata and decompiled instructions (cached Iced `Instruction[]`)."
